 "description": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Sobre a oportunidade</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Estamos em busca de uma pessoa organizada, proativa e comprometida para integrar o time regulat&oacute;rio, em regime de trabalho remoto. A atua&ccedil;&atilde;o envolver&aacute;, principalmente, a elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o de respostas de NIP, bem como o apoio &agrave;s demais demandas da equipe regulat&oacute;ria, com interface interna e suporte &agrave;s rotinas t&eacute;cnicas do escrit&oacute;rio.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Principais atividades</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Elaborar respostas de NIP, garantindo qualidade t&eacute;cnica, clareza e ader&ecirc;ncia &agrave;s normas da ANS;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Apoiar a equipe regulat&oacute;ria em demandas diversas, al&eacute;m das respostas de NIP, conforme necessidade da &aacute;rea;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Auxiliar na an&aacute;lise e condu&ccedil;&atilde;o de quest&otilde;es regulat&oacute;rias relacionadas &agrave; sa&uacute;de suplementar;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Atuar em conjunto com diferentes equipes, contribuindo para o fluxo, organiza&ccedil;&atilde;o e acompanhamento das demandas;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Montserrat Light';\">Participar de treinamentos, reuni&otilde;es e alinhame